        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion A4-0 Sandcast Bronze Beveled Round Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Round Beveled deadbolt has an old world feel that is a beautiful as it is versatile since it will look great on period style homes as well as more modern houses. It is available as either single cylinder or double cylinder; and both meet ANSI 156.5 grade 2 criteria. Available in dark bronze and medium bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten Bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion A4 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</li>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for River Rock Collection Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Beveled Round Sandcast Deadbolt, Fusion A4",
                "description": "Sandcast Beveled Round Deadbolt Fusion A4 - Fusion Hardware's Round Beveled deadbolt has an old world feel that is a beautiful as it is versatile since it will look great on period style homes as well as more modern houses. It is available as either single cylinder or double cylinder; and both meet ANSI 156.5 grade 2 criteria. Available in Dark Bronze and Medium Bronze finishes.",
